 decarbonising the grid through multi-sector synergies. Paper submission op
 ens on 1 February 2027\; early submissions get rolling notification.\n\nCa
 ll for papers: https://cyprusconferences.org/upec2027/\nDetails: https://l
 angestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/upec27
